  "description": {
    "zh": "唯一目的是验证「同一套代码，换 JSON 就是另一只狗」。它需要更长时间建立信任，容易被吓到，但一旦亲近就非常黏人。",
    "en": "Exists to prove that one codebase plus different JSON equals a different animal. Slow to trust, easily startled, but deeply attached once bonded."
  },

